@UserApi = http://localhost:5003

### All 100 dummy users
GET {{UserApi}}/users?pageSize=100
Accept: application/json

### City and age filters
GET {{UserApi}}/users?city=Ankara&minAge=25&maxAge=45
Accept: application/json

### Search and pagination
GET {{UserApi}}/users?search=Ali&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### One user
GET {{UserApi}}/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a user (repeating the same email returns 409)
POST {{UserApi}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Burak",
  "lastName": "Onen",
  "email": "burak@example.com",
  "age": 30,
  "city": "Istanbul"
}
